:## Appendix C: Bus events\n2131:## Appendix D: `game.debug`\ntotal 176\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha   4096 Nov  4 06:02 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha   4096 Nov  4 06:02 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 154048 Nov  4 06:02 PLAN.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha    347 Nov  4 06:02 STAGE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha   8791 Nov  4 06:02 TASK.md\nREADME.md\naudit.json\ndashboard.html\ndashboard.mjs\nmatrix.config.json\nprompt-template.md\nrun-matrix.mjs\nrun-record.mjs\nrun-record.schema.json\nruns\nstart-dashboard.ps1\nstart-dashboard.sh\ntest","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-060225__x4549c1/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JhsUrZ3Dxpsq3hmfXJLkco","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
