{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: Not satisfied: the final reply has all four sections, the single .html is in the work folder root, and exit-interview.json parses with every field answered. But TASK.md requires every feature implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, and the transcript does not establish that. The 'Tour' was only partly checked (the bot lost one tour game and the post-game path was not exercised there, and 'all four games and the boss are playable' was asserted without a test). The final output also contains 'pending' placeholder text in the About screen before it was replaced, and the AI Hub mode was changed from the plan's ghost to parallel with no check of which mode TASK.md's hub requirement expects. Also, the .html and exit-interview.json are in the work folder, not the dev folder, which matches STAGE.md, so that part is fine. Several TASK.md features (Xbox setting, touch-only screen, attract mode) were verified, but full feature completeness and absence of stubs were not demonstrated."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae684082-f21f-4a2b-8baf-c73d93056a9d","uuid":"a8de0ecf-c967-475f-b9e8-a6153961630f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:56:01.852Z","isSynthetic":true}
